portsniffer-driver
==================

This project is a fork and customization of the upstream "ENLYZE PortSniffer"
project, originally created by Colin Finck (ENLYZE GmbH).

The driver and CLI tool sources retain their original MIT copyright notices
as required by the MIT license. Additions, fixes and the surrounding tooling
in this repository are Copyright (c) 2025 Bahrom0311.

Notable changes from the upstream project:
  - Two maintained variants under variants/ (single-port, multi-port)
  - Multi-SZ string iteration bug fixed in installation.c and setup.c
  - HTTP forwarding pipeline and Flask ingest server
  - WinForms launcher around the CLI
  - Repository restructured: legacy snapshots moved to archive/legacy

